---
import ActionIcon from './ActionIcon.astro';
const image='/images/ashbi/hty-foods/thanksgiving-email.webp';
---
<section class="section container email-work" aria-labelledby="campaign-project-heading">
  <div class="email-work-copy"><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL MARKETING / HTY FOODS</span><h2 id="campaign-project-heading">A seasonal offer.<br /><em>A clear next step.</em></h2><p>For HTY Foods, the Thanksgiving email brings the offer, promotional code and featured product into one connected design.</p><p>The red and gold campaign treatment leads into a product section with its own shopping action. It’s an example of the focused creative deliverables we can support alongside your wider marketing activity.</p><ul><li>Seasonal campaign layout</li><li>Offer and product hierarchy</li><li>Brand-consistent email creative</li></ul><p class="email-work-caption">Original email artwork from the project file. The promotion shown has ended.</p><p>For a broader ongoing relationship, explore our creative partnership with <a href="/work/della/">Della Rice</a>.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.figma.com/design/NHkdoXL2dK0IZrjpBXs8Ug/HYT-Foods?node-id=5-649">View the original design <ActionIcon name="external" /></a></div>
  <a class="email-work-art" href={image} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View the full HTY email design (opens in a new tab)"><img src={image} alt="HTY Thanksgiving email design with a seasonal offer and grilled beef jerky product section" width="800" height="2024" loading="lazy" /></a>
  <div class="production-work"><a href="/images/ashbi/kalm/sticker-pack-1200.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View the Kalm College Circle sticker production sheet (opens in a new tab)"><img src="/images/ashbi/kalm/sticker-pack-1200.png" alt="Kalm College Circle sticker production sheet with several marks, badges and name-tag formats" width="1200" height="637" loading="lazy" /></a><div><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCTION WORK / KALM</span><h3>Ready for the <em>next format.</em></h3><p>This Kalm College Circle sheet brings an established visual direction into a set of stickers and name tags. Ashbi’s role here was production work on the artwork.</p><a class="text-link production-case-link" href="/work/production-work/">Explore the production work case <ActionIcon name="forward" /></a></div></div>
</section>
<style>
.email-work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;grid-template-areas:"art copy" "production production";gap:clamp(30px,6vw,85px);align-items:center;padding-block:72px}.email-work-copy{grid-area:copy}.email-work-art{grid-area:art;display:flex;justify-content:center;background:#eeeae3;border-radius:24px;padding:24px}.email-work-art img{width:min(100%,260px);height:auto;box-shadow:0 12px 28px #292c5020}.email-work h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem)}.email-work p{max-width:620px;color:var(--muted)}.email-work li{margin-block:10px}.email-work ul{padding-left:20px;margin-block:24px}.email-work .email-work-caption{font-size:.78rem}.email-work .text-link{font-size:.73rem}@media(max-width:760px){.email-work{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-areas:"copy" "art" "production";padding-block:48px}.email-work-art img{width:min(100%,260px)}}
.production-work{grid-area:production;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,70px);align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:clamp(28px,5vw,56px)}
.production-work>a{display:block;min-width:0;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#151123}
.production-work img{width:100%;height:auto}
.production-work h3{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3vw,3.1rem);margin-bottom:18px}
.production-work p{margin-bottom:0}
.production-case-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px}
@media(max-width:760px){.production-work{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.production-work>a{order:1}.production-work>div{order:2}}
</style>
